# Exactly as [[state]]d; [[read]] or [[understand|understood]] without additional [[interpretation]]; [[accord]]ing to the [[letter]] or verbal expression; [[real]]; not [[figurative]] or [[metaphorical]], and {{l|en|etymon|etymonic}} rather than {{l|en|idiom|idiomatic}}.
#: {{ux|en|The '''literal''' translation is "hands full of bananas" but it means "empty-handed".}}
